  "description": "What's your rocky-trail secret? Plush, wide, smooth rolling Kenda Havoc 2.8\" tires, pumped to your preferred air pressure: low for maximum cush, or higher for faster rides. Designed for Plus tires, the HT3's 6061-T6 high-end aluminum alloy frame with internal cable routing is paired with the Boost compatible HL Vaxa suspension fork and Pivit Boost alloy disc hubs, to match and compliment oversized Plus tires. Your feature-rich component package includes new 1x10 Shimano / SunRace drive train, 2-pc crankset, Tektro disc brakes and tubeless-ready WTB TCS wheels.\n6061-T6 27.5\" Plus alloy frame, internal cable routing, tapered 1.5\" head tube, 12x148mm Boost thru-axle dropouts\nNew HL 866 Vaxa fork, 120mm travel, taper steerer, Boost 110mm axle w/ Q/R\nFPD DOZER tapered headset\n2-pc crankset w/ narrow-wide 30T chainring, 24mm Axle, Boost compatible\nShimano Deore 1x10 Shadow Plus rear derailleur & Deore shifter\nSunRace 10-spd 11-40T cassette\nNew Tubeless ready WTB Scraper i35 rims\nNew Kenda Havoc 120 tpi 27.5x2.8\" tires\nPivit Boost alloy disc hubs, 32h, 12x148mm rear thru-axle\nNew upper chain-guide",
